# Copy to .env.local. Both values are server-only (never NEXT_PUBLIC_): the browser never calls
# FastAPI; src/lib/api/server.ts reads them.
BACKEND_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
# Sent as X-Internal-Key. Must equal SMC_INTERNAL_KEY on the scanner API; leave both empty on a
# single-user machine where the API is bound to loopback.
BACKEND_INTERNAL_KEY=
# PORT=3000
